="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MOROOKA, HISASHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAITO, SADAMU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIRONE, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ITO YUZO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MOROOKA HISASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SAITO SADAMU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHIRONE TAKASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ITO, YUZO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MOROOKA, HISASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAITO, SADAMU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIRONE, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A power transmission/distribution apparatus having a high performance and hardly contributing to global warming by using an insulating medium which has a high dielectric breakdown strength, is flame-retardent or nonflammable, and has an extremely small global warming potential. The insulating medium is sealed in a bus (2), a bus disconnector (4), connection buses (5, 7), current transformers (9, 10), a breaker (8), connection buses (13, 16, 18), a voltage transformer (17), a lightning arrester (19), and so forth.  Insulating spacers (20) are used for partition. The insulating medium is a compound of a composition expressed by CxHyFzI or CaHbFcI (where y+z=2x+1, z&gt;y, x is a natural number of 6 or less, z is a natural number, y is 0 or a natural number, b+c=2a, c&gt;b, a is a natural number from 3 to 6, c is a natural number, and b is 0 or a natural number).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'appareil concerne un appareil de distribution/transmission d'énergie, à performance élevée, contribuant à peine au chauffage global grâce à un milieu isolant présentant une résistance au claquage diélectrique élevée, retardateur de flamme ou ininflammable, et à potentiel de chauffage global extrêmement petit. L'appareil comprend un milieu isolant scellé dans un bus (2), un déconnecteur de bus (4), des bus de connexion (5, 7), des transformateurs de tension (9, 10), un coupe-circuit (8), des bus de connexion (13, 16, 18), un transformateur d'intensité (17), un interrupteur (19) etc. Les espaceurs (20) isolant sont utilisés la séparation. Le milieu isolant est un composé représenté par la formule CxHyFzI ou CaHbFcI (où y+z=2x+1, z&gt;y), x est un nombre entier naturel égal ou inférieur à 6, z est un nombre entier naturel, y est égal à 0 ou à un nombre entier naturel, b+c=2a, c&gt;b, a est un nombre entier naturel compris entre 3 et 6, c est un nombre entier naturel, et b est égal à 0 ou à un nombre entier naturel).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>